BACKUP ~weidu_external/IE-Voices-Pack/backup~
SUPPORT ~https://github.com/Sauler89~
VERSION ~1.0~
README ~README.md~

LANGUAGE ~English~ ~english~ ~IE-Voices-Pack/language/english/setup.tra~

// Complete source-game packs

BEGIN @51000
DESIGNATED 1000
LABEL IE-VOICES-PACK-BG
GROUP @50000
REQUIRE_PREDICATE GAME_IS ~bgee bg2ee iwdee eet~ @59000
FORBID_COMPONENT ~zg_bg_voices/zg_bg_voices.tp2~ 0 @59001
LOAD_TRA ~%MOD_FOLDER%/sources/bg/english/setup.tra~
INCLUDE ~%MOD_FOLDER%/lib/bg.tpa~

